{"id":"lastkingdom","name":"Tower Defense (Last Kingdom)","folder":"37_lastkingdom","intro":null,"help":[],"tables":[{"name":"ArcadeManager","rows":1},{"name":"ArchiveManager","rows":1},{"name":"Manager","rows":2},{"name":"Mission","rows":49},{"name":"Tutorial","rows":5},{"name":"TutorialList","rows":31},{"name":"TutorialPage","rows":42},{"name":"Buff","rows":107},{"name":"BurstDialog","rows":14},{"name":"Cinematic","rows":15},{"name":"Debuff","rows":47},{"name":"Monster","rows":902},{"name":"MonsterSkill","rows":57},{"name":"ScenarioGroup","rows":21},{"name":"ScenarioList","rows":181},{"name":"Speaker","rows":17},{"name":"Stage","rows":20},{"name":"Tower","rows":86},{"name":"TowerSkill","rows":138},{"name":"UpgradeGroup","rows":12},{"name":"UpgradeList","rows":60},{"name":"WaveData","rows":289},{"name":"WavePath","rows":8237},{"name":"WavePathRandom","rows":1188}],"view":{"summary":"A tower defense game: build and upgrade towers along the Raptures’ path, deploy Nikkes and aim their Burst Skills, and stop every wave before your Defense Points run out.","overview":[{"type":"facts","title":"How it plays","items":[["Goal","Raptures enter in waves and follow the road to the kingdom. Each one that gets through costs Defense Points (a boss costs all of them). Story stages are won by defeating the boss of the last wave."],["Gold","You start a stage with some gold and earn more for every Rapture defeated and for starting a wave early (Quick Start). Gold builds towers, upgrades them, learns tower skills and opens Nikke slots."],["Towers","Four tower lines (Gun, Pulse Gun, Cannon, Ice Cannon) go from Lv. 1 to Lv. 3, then evolve into one of two specialist towers that can learn two skills. Building takes 1 s, selling 0.5 s; a sold tower refunds 70% of the gold spent."],["Nikkes","Hero towers placed in Nikke slots (first one free, then 110 gold, +40 for each further slot). Each Nikke can be deployed once per stage; drag her slot onto the map to fire her Burst Skill, which then has a cooldown that keeps running even if she is removed."],["Air units","Flying Raptures can only be hit by towers that attack air (cannons, the EMP and ice cannons hit only the ground)."],["Camouflage","Some Raptures turn invisible from time to time; only towers that see through optical camouflage (Sniper Tower, Crown) or skills that remove it can hit them then."],["Broken Cores","A pile of broken cores from Raptures.\nCan be used to upgrade towers. Earned from first clears of the stages and spent on permanent upgrades."],["Challenge",["An endless stage of up to 99 random waves, scored for Raptures defeated and waves survived; your best score counts for the Union ranking.",{"page":"stage-100119","label":"See the waves"}]],["Intro story",null]]},{"type":"table","title":"Stages","columns":["Stage","Type",{"label":"Waves","num":true},{"label":"Start gold","num":true},{"label":"Nikkes","num":true},"First clear"],"rows":[[{"page":"stage-100101","label":"EX-1 Kingdom Defense"},"Story",6,100,1,{"reward":{"userExp":0,"characterExp":0,"items":[{"type":"Item","id":9201001,"name":"Central Government Supply Chest I","icon":{"family":"icons-consume","name":"icn_consume_selectbox"},"amount":3,"chance":100}]}}],[{"page":"stage-100102","label":"EX-1-1 Kingdom Defense II"},"Stage",7,200,1,{"reward":{"userExp":0,"characterExp":0,"items":[{"type":"Item","id":7010002,"name":"Ultra Boost Module","icon":{"family":"icons-material","name":"icn_material_equipment_exp_sr"},"amount":5,"chance":100}]}}],[{"page":"stage-100103","label":"EX-1-2 Kingdom Defense III"},"Stage",7,250,2,{"reward":{"userExp":0,"characterExp":0,"items":[{"type":"Currency","id":5200,"name":"Advanced Recruit Voucher","amount":1,"chance":100}]}}],[{"page":"stage-100104","label":"EX-2 Incessant Attacks"},"Story",7,200,2,{"reward":{"userExp":0,"characterExp":0,"items":[{"type":"Item","id":9201001,"name":"Central Government Supply Chest I","icon":{"family":"icons-consume","name":"icn_consume_selectbox"},"amount":3,"chance":